### ===========================================================
### Direct OpenAI API examples
### Test against: https://api.openai.com
### ===========================================================

@baseUrl = https://api.openai.com
@apiKey = {{OPENAI_API_KEY}}
@model = gpt-4o-mini

# Add this in VS Code user settings (Settings JSON):
# "rest-client.environmentVariables": {
#   "local": {
#     "OPENAI_API_KEY": "sk-...your-key..."
#   }
# }
# Then the value above resolves from {{OPENAI_API_KEY}}.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MODELS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List available models
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

### Simple chat completion
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Hello! Reply in one sentence." }
  ]
}

###

### Chat completion with system + user prompt
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant." },
    { "role": "user", "content": "Summarize the benefits of using API-first services." }
  ],
  "temperature": 0.7
}

###

### Streaming response
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Count from 1 to 5." }
  ],
  "stream": true
}

###

### JSON mode
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "response_format": { "type": "json_object" },
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Return a JSON object with keys name and age for a fictional person." }
  ]
}

###

### Embeddings
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/embeddings
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog."
}

###

### Responses API (newer OpenAI format)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "input": "Write a two-sentence greeting to a new developer."
}
